WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:01.480
Bueno.

00:00:01.840 --> 00:00:02.760
But can you tell me

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:03.920
more about Mia Rose?

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.160
Who is she?

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:08.160
That's my mom.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.480
When I was a baby,

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:11.480
 she had a falling out

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:12.800
with my grandma.

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:16.360
So, she stayed in

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:18.240
Scranton, Pennsylvania,

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.880
and we moved here.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.800
That’s all you know?

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:28.680
Deal?

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:30.320
Or have you

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:31.520
changed your mind?
